{
  "description": "Links:\n Part 1\n\n Part 2\n\n Part 3\n\n Part 4\n\n* Part 5\nThis custom PCR1 Setup protocol is part 1/5 of the Verogen ForenSeq DNA Signature Prep kit. In this protocol, mastermix is pre-added to a clean PCR plate. Then, samples from up to 4 source plates specified in the .csv file are transferred to the plate containing mastermix and mixed (optionally).\nThe .csv file should be formatted as shown below (including header line):\nvolume,source plate # (1-4),source column (1-12),destination column(1-12)\n8,1,2,1\n8,2,3,2\n8,2,12,3",
  "tags": [
    "NGS Library Prep",
    "Verogen ForenSeq DNA Signature Prep Kit"
  ],
  "labware": [
    {
      "name": "plate 4 on 2",
      "slot": "2",
      "type": "lab_amplifyt_96_wellplate_200ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "Opentrons 96 Tip Rack 20 µL on 3",
      "slot": "3",
      "type": "lab_opentrons_96_tiprack_20ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "plate 3 on 5",
      "slot": "5",
      "type": "lab_amplifyt_96_wellplate_200ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "mastermix tubes (strip column 1) on 6",
      "slot": "6",
      "type": "lab_opentrons_96_aluminumblock_generic_pcr_strip_200ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "Opentrons 96 Tip Rack 20 µL on 7",
      "slot": "7",
      "type": "lab_opentrons_96_tiprack_20ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "plate 2 on 8",
      "slot": "8",
      "type": "lab_amplifyt_96_wellplate_200ul"
    },
    {
      "name": "destination plate on 9",
      "slot": "9",
      "type": "lab_amplifyt_96_wellplate_200ul"
    },
